holds              0 held
owed               1 a plan is already owed (a first plan is owed)
adapted            1 the plan is adapted at docs/MILESTONES.md, and only a native plan at docs/MILESTONES.md can have a replacement adopted
elsewhere          1 the plan is native at PLAN.md, and only a native plan at docs/MILESTONES.md can have a replacement adopted
project-park       1 the project is parked (plan-unreadable)
planning-leftover  0 held
planning-live      1 another lane runs from this plan (M00-plan)
sibling-rowless    1 another lane runs from this plan (M03)
